                                            "b":  "Whales adapting their calls to overcome shipping noise may expend energy that could otherwise support feeding and migration.",
                                            "c":  "Shipping noise has no measurable effect on how whales communicate, contrary to the text.",
                                            "d":  "Whales in busy shipping lanes call more quietly and less often in order to conserve energy, contrary to the text."
