                                            "b":  "Indifferent, presenting no evaluation of the practice, unlike the actual tone.",
                                            "c":  "Comedic, treating the issue as unimportant, unlike the critical tone used.",
                                            "d":  "Fully supportive, praising manufacturers for their innovation, opposite to the tone."
